LOCATION:Royale\, 279 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116
DESCRIPTION:with Grace Enger\nStella Lefty is a Los Angeles-based singer-so
 ngwriter carving out a name with her emotionally sharp songwriting and a s
 ound that seamlessly blends pop sensibility with country storytelling. Her
